@startuml
title UC-1: View Enrolled and Shoppingcart Classes

actor Student
participant "Browser Extension" as Extension
participant "University Website" as Website

Student -> Extension: Open extension

Extension -> Website: Search enrolled and shoppingcart classes
Website --> Extension: Return enrolled and shoppingcart classes

Extension -> Extension: Process class data

Extension --> Student: Display class overview\n(classname, teacher, schedule,\nlocation, seats)

alt classes found
    Extension --> Student: Show enrolled and planned classes
else No classes found
    Extension --> Student: Show "No classes found"
end

@enduml